```yaml
spec:
  web_resource_requirements:
    requests: {cpu: 250m, memory: 1Gi}
    limits: {cpu: 1000m, memory: 4Gi}
  task_resource_requirements:
    requests: {cpu: 250m, memory: 1Gi}
    limits: {cpu: 2000m, memory: 4Gi}
  redis_resource_requirements:
    requests: {cpu: 250m, memory: 1Gi}
    limits: {cpu: 1000m, memory: 4Gi}
```

- Limits should sum to the node's actual resources.
- If only limits are set, requests default to the limits; set requests lower (about 25% of the node).
- Use `topology_spread_constraints` to spread control pods across nodes.
